  portion of finance charges of Rs.197.90 lakhs consequent to preclosure of
  term loans from Bank&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;/td&gt;
 &lt;/tr&gt;
 &lt;tr&gt;
  &lt;td&gt;
